WEBVTT

41:35.227 --> 41:37.313
We'll speak when I return.

41:38.939 --> 41:41.442
(WIND HOWLING)

41:52.995 --> 41:55.998
- A bear's balls.
- TYRION: Oh, you're joking?

41:56.123 --> 41:59.543
And his brains and his guts,
his lungs and his heart,

41:59.668 --> 42:02.171
all fried in his own fat.
